2353       data a (drop=i);
2354       do i=1 to 1000;
2355       x1=rannor(1234);
2356       x2=rannor(1234);
2357       e=rannor(1234);
2358       if i > 950 then y=100 + 10*e;
2359       else y=10 + 5*x1 + 3*x2 + 0.5 * e;
2360       output;
2361       end;
2362       run;

NOTE: The data set WORK.A has 1000 observations and 4 variables.

2363       proc quantreg data=a;
2364       model y = x1 x2 / seed=314159;
2365       run;

NOTE: No valid quantiles are specified. PROC QUANTREG computes median regression.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE QUANTREG printed page 82.

2366       proc quantreg algorithm=interior(tolerance=1e-6)
2367       ci=none data=a;
2368       model y = x1 x2 / itprint nosummary seed=314159;
2369       run;

NOTE: No valid quantiles are specified. PROC QUANTREG computes median regression.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE QUANTREG printed pages 83-84.

2370       proc quantreg algorithm=smooth(rratio=.5) ci=none data=a;
2371       model y = x1 x2 / itprint nosummary seed=314159;
2372       run;

NOTE: No valid quantiles are specified. PROC QUANTREG computes median regression.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE QUANTREG printed pages 85-86.

